description:

Twilio is a cloud communications platform for software developers to build, scale and operate real time
communications in their software applications. Twilio powers the future of business communications, enabling
phones, VoIP, and messaging to be embedded into web, desktop, and mobile software. We take care of the messy telecom
hardware and expose a globally available cloud API so developers can interact with intelligent & complex communications
systems.

